  "details": "When I logged into my profile after clicking \"Login\" on the Main page, the profile page looked more... HTML'y.\n\nRunning Chrome Version 117.0.5938.152 (Official Build) (64-bit) on Windows 10.\n\nChrome extensions include: Malwarebytes Browser Guard, uBlock Origin, AdBlack.\n\nSteps for repro:\n\n1. Go to vrchat.com\n\n2. Click \"Login\" at top right.\n\nI was already signed in, and was not taken to the password screen, jumped immediately to my profile -- maybe it loaded too fast. Refreshing the webpage fixed this bug,",
